rooms_desc ({"This a church located in the middle of the world.People comes here to pray to the St. JaerLord of Time and Space. There are many strange looking windows here.There is nothing special except for the design of the window.","This room contains the most price items in the world of Holy Mission.There are many guards and Danadras here.  They seems to be guarding here.So, Becareful what you take and touch.You notices it's the treasury room of Jaer.","This a old closet located in Jaer's houseThere is also the garbage dump for Jaer.He dump the useless stuff here.Feel free to take anything here.","This is another old room located in Jaer's houseThere is a huge boulder blocking you from entering somewhere.Hmm... Maybe you can find a way to get in?","This is a old, old closet located in Jaer's houseTHere is nothing special here.","There are many boats tie to port here.Strange....There are many guards here.  What could they be guarding here?Maybe something of huge value?",0,0,0,0,})
